params:query {
  from: 
  to: 
}

docs {
  # Call Stats

  Returns call analytics for a date range:
  - total calls
  - breakdown by status (idle/ringing/connecting/connected/ended/failed)
  - average duration in seconds
  - audio vs video split

  ## Query params
  - from, to — ISO date strings (e.g. 2026-06-01, 2026-06-30)
}
